  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wr 301.01 Purpose. The purpose of this chapter is to ensure that existing dams are maintained in a manner so that public safety and the environment are protected.\n\nSource. #4399, eff 4-19-88; ss by #5080, eff 2-22-91; ss by #6462-B, eff 2-21-97; ss by #8285, INTERIM, eff 2-21-05, EXPIRES: 8-20-05; ss by #8414, eff 8-20-05; ss by #10510, eff 1-22-14; ss by #13980, eff 5-24-24",
